</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="remark"><para>TexFmt_Y16_L Samples a 2D color gradient texture in Y16 linear format (NV097_SET_TEXTURE_FORMAT_COLOR_LU_IMAGE_Y16, format 0x35).</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="remark"><para>TexFmt_Y8 Samples a 2D color gradient texture in Y8 swizzled format.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="remark"><para>TexFmt_Y8_L Samples a 2D color gradient texture in Y8 linear format.</para>
